        "hero_title": "Understanding Diamonds",
        "hero_tagline": "A masterclass in the 4 C's: Colour, Carat Weight, Cut, and Clarity",
        "hero_intro": "<p>Diamonds are captivating marvels of nature, coveted for their beauty and timeless allure. Beyond their sparkling facade lies information every diamond buyer should understand.</p>",
        "hero_image_alt": "Inspecting a diamond under magnification",
        "hero_image_fallback": "inspecting-diamonds-magnification.webp"
